<title>USA: Mesa, Ariz., $94.7 mln utility deal won by Goldman.</title>
<headline>Mesa, Ariz., $94.7 mln utility deal won by Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. said Monday it won Mesa, Ariz.'s $94.7 million utility system revenue bond deal at a net interest cost of 5.610 percent.</p>
</text>
